{
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "slug": "copy-button",
  "title": "Copy button",
  "group": "Actions",
  "order": 8,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A button that copies a value to the clipboard and confirms in place: the copy icon blurs into a check and the label says \"Copied\" for 1.6 s. One attribute, `data-lds-copy`, holds the text.",
    "id": "Tombol yang menyalin nilai ke clipboard dan mengonfirmasi di tempat: ikon salin memudar menjadi centang dan labelnya berbunyi \"Disalin\" selama 1,6 detik. Satu atribut, `data-lds-copy`, menyimpan teksnya."
  },
  "titleId": "Copy button",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Inside a field",
        "desc": "Press Copy: the icon blurs into a check and the label changes, then both return.",
        "html": "<div class=\"control\" style=\"width: 380px; max-width: 100%; padding-right: 6px;\">\n  <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: 400 14px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--text-default); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\">IZIN-7Q4K-2026</span>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--gray btn--sm\" data-lds-copy=\"IZIN-7Q4K-2026\" style=\"min-width: 84px;\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px;\"><span class=\"ic ic--sm swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic ic--sm swap__b\" style=\"color: var(--success-text);\">check</span></span><span data-lds-copy-label=\"Copied\" aria-live=\"polite\">Copy</span></button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Icon only",
        "desc": "Where space is tight (a message action row). The name stays \"Copy message\"; a hidden live span announces \"Copied\".",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\">\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy message\" data-lds-copy=\"Counter 3, 09:00. Bring your original KTP.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\" style=\"color: var(--success-text);\">check</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\" data-lds-copy-label=\"Copied\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Copy message</span></span>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Di dalam kolom",
        "desc": "Tekan Salin: ikon memudar menjadi centang dan label berganti, lalu keduanya kembali.",
        "html": "<div class=\"control\" style=\"width: 380px; max-width: 100%; padding-right: 6px;\">\n  <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: 400 14px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--text-default); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\">IZIN-7Q4K-2026</span>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--gray btn--sm\" data-lds-copy=\"IZIN-7Q4K-2026\" style=\"min-width: 84px;\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px;\"><span class=\"ic ic--sm swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic ic--sm swap__b\" style=\"color: var(--success-text);\">check</span></span><span data-lds-copy-label=\"Disalin\" aria-live=\"polite\">Salin</span></button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Hanya ikon",
        "desc": "Saat ruang sempit (baris aksi pesan). Namanya tetap \"Salin pesan\"; span live tersembunyi mengumumkan \"Disalin\".",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\">\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin pesan\" data-lds-copy=\"Loket 3, pukul 09.00. Bawa KTP asli.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\" style=\"color: var(--success-text);\">check</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\" data-lds-copy-label=\"Disalin\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Salin pesan</span></span>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
